    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.58,
      554.76,
      554.86,
      587.06
    ],
    "text": "Showers will occur at times in Western and Sabaragamuwa, provinces and in Galle, Matara, Kandy and Nuwara-Eliya districts.",
